customer: activist_guy
problem: bad_ram
daypart: afternoon
brief:
	Really a hacker; the player's character calls him the activist. He knows what is wrong, asks for new RAM and says little. His computer holds hints that he researches Cambion.

== drop-off
(neutral) Hello! Have you got a minute?
- Busy day?
	(neutral) Always. The newsletter doesn't write itself.
- Nice button. What's it for?
	(happy) Saving the old park from the asphalt overlords. You should sign our petition!
- Right. So, computer problems?
	(problem) Yes. On boot, BIOS fails POST. Somewhere in the 8M range.
	(thinking) Most likely RAM, but it could be the mobo I suppose, a weak trace or a blown cap...
	(neutral) I'd fix it myself. No time, no spares. Gotta get to my research.
	- I'll take care of it for you.
	- Uh... POST...? It's fine, I'll fix it. 
	- Research...?
		(irritated02) Something about a distro. It's... I'm investigating.
	(neutral) I need my box for the newsletter, so please be quick.
	- I'll do my best. Have a FUNtastic day!

== pick-up
(neutral) It POSTs? Wonderful.
- Happy I could help.
	(neutral) Was it the new memory?
	- Yeah.
- That upgrade...
(irritated02) Yeah, I figured. Next time I'm not getting parts off of DALnet.
- Maybe come back here next time you need an upgrade and I'll throw in a discount for you.
	(happy) Thanks dude. I'll keep that in mind.
	- Take care now.
